WEBVTT

00:01:09.200 --> 00:01:19.850
Flowering Youth

00:01:31.000 --> 00:01:35.290
"Innocent Girl"

00:01:49.240 --> 00:01:51.220
You two fighting again?

00:01:53.000 --> 00:01:56.230
You always get worked up over Mustafa, Lee-Leng.

00:01:56.260 --> 00:01:57.230
I do not.

00:01:59.120 --> 00:02:00.000
See?

00:02:00.270 --> 00:02:03.080
He just hates me.

00:02:03.110 --> 00:02:04.270
That's not true.

00:02:07.000 --> 00:02:10.150
Mustafa wants to be your friend.

00:02:11.210 --> 00:02:12.230
Right?

00:02:17.160 --> 00:02:18.080
Look.

00:02:22.100 --> 00:02:24.010
Kajika?

00:02:56.020 --> 00:02:57.130
Lady Kajika?

00:02:58.250 --> 00:03:00.040
Lady Kajika.

00:03:04.200 --> 00:03:06.140
Were you dreaming?

00:03:07.290 --> 00:03:10.050
Seemed like fun.

00:03:10.280 --> 00:03:14.200
Yes, it was a very happy dream.

00:03:18.080 --> 00:03:21.230
Toranosuke?  Is that the school I'm attending?

00:03:22.290 --> 00:03:25.120
Yes.  But Lady Kajika...

00:03:26.100 --> 00:03:31.130
I beg that you try to lay low.  You're very noticeable as it is.

00:03:37.110 --> 00:03:39.210
Let us welcome the new student.

00:03:41.010 --> 00:03:43.140
Kajika Kugami.

00:03:45.190 --> 00:03:50.060
She's been raised in the U.S. due to her father's work.

00:03:53.040 --> 00:03:57.030
She'll doubtlessly be unfamiliar with many things, so please help her.

00:03:58.190 --> 00:04:00.190
What silver eyes...

00:04:02.060 --> 00:04:04.190
A genuine beauty.

00:04:10.110 --> 00:04:12.050
Go talk to her.

00:04:12.140 --> 00:04:14.270
What?

00:04:18.220 --> 00:04:20.180
Ms. Kugami?

00:04:21.260 --> 00:04:23.210
Um...

00:04:27.050 --> 00:04:30.080
Why am I blushing like this?

00:04:32.160 --> 00:04:37.080
I'm Yui Yamate.  Pleased to meet you.

00:04:38.020 --> 00:04:39.080
Nice to meet you, too.

00:04:44.220 --> 00:04:47.200
Well, I mustered the courage to speak to her.

00:04:49.270 --> 00:04:51.250
But what do I say now?

00:04:55.080 --> 00:04:57.250
Why do you look away?

00:04:58.030 --> 00:05:00.000
Is something wrong?

00:05:01.090 --> 00:05:03.020
Huh?!  No, of course not!

00:05:03.110 --> 00:05:05.030
Nothing at all!

00:05:06.240 --> 00:05:08.020
That's a relief.

00:05:11.080 --> 00:05:13.060
What're you two talking about?

00:05:13.090 --> 00:05:14.170
Let us in!

00:05:14.290 --> 00:05:16.230
First time to Japan?

00:05:16.260 --> 00:05:18.170
Are you fluent in English?

00:05:19.020 --> 00:05:20.230
So you grew up in America?

00:05:21.180 --> 00:05:24.150
Did you have a boyfriend there?

00:05:26.040 --> 00:05:27.080
Boyfriend?

00:05:29.150 --> 00:05:33.020
No...but there was someone that I loved.

00:05:33.130 --> 00:05:34.170
Loved?!

00:05:35.250 --> 00:05:41.220
Mustafa was nobler, stronger, and more beautiful than any boy I'd ever meet.

00:05:42.260 --> 00:05:44.170
Mustafa, huh?

00:05:45.010 --> 00:05:47.290
With streaked green and gold eyes.

00:05:49.190 --> 00:05:53.290
At night, those eyes shined like topaz.

00:05:54.180 --> 00:05:56.030
Topaz?!

00:05:56.150 --> 00:06:00.070
We were inseparable.

00:06:01.060 --> 00:06:03.030
Even when we slept.

00:06:04.260 --> 00:06:08.260
I often combed his silvery fur.

00:06:09.080 --> 00:06:10.210
Fur!

00:06:11.100 --> 00:06:12.250
Wait...fur?

00:06:13.110 --> 00:06:19.020
Yes.  Mustafa was a pure white and silvery spotted...

00:06:19.210 --> 00:06:21.030
white leopard.

00:06:27.070 --> 00:06:30.110
Everyone thinks you're teasing them!

00:06:31.000 --> 00:06:33.140
But why?  It's the truth.

00:06:33.210 --> 00:06:36.170
Mustafa's been my only love.

00:06:39.190 --> 00:06:41.180
We lived together for 10 years.

00:06:42.100 --> 00:06:45.040
I wished it were forever.

00:06:47.200 --> 00:06:50.280
Umm....what happened to him?

00:06:52.020 --> 00:06:53.030
He died.

00:06:53.210 --> 00:06:56.060
I wanted to die with him.

00:06:57.210 --> 00:07:01.050
Mustafa was everything to me.

00:07:03.230 --> 00:07:05.080
I'm sorry.

00:07:06.020 --> 00:07:10.050
Ms. Kugami...I believe you.

00:07:10.280 --> 00:07:12.060
I do.

00:07:13.100 --> 00:07:14.200
Call me Kajika.

00:07:15.220 --> 00:07:17.030
Kajika.

00:07:24.090 --> 00:07:26.210
School was fun today.

00:07:43.120 --> 00:07:45.190
Kajika, wow!

00:07:46.010 --> 00:07:48.260
You're incredible!

00:07:50.020 --> 00:07:52.000
"Girl's Dressing Room"

00:07:58.130 --> 00:08:00.170
Kajika!  Hurry up!

00:08:01.150 --> 00:08:04.170
Let's eat!  I'm starving!

00:08:08.290 --> 00:08:11.170
What?  Only strawberries?

00:08:11.290 --> 00:08:15.090
Until now, my diet's been strictly regimented.

00:08:15.190 --> 00:08:19.150
But I plan to eat whatever I like from now on.

00:08:20.020 --> 00:08:25.060
I hear you.  My mom always scolds me for not eating my bell peppers.

00:08:25.170 --> 00:08:26.280
Want some?

00:08:27.070 --> 00:08:31.010
What, really?  Sure!  Don't mind if I do!

00:08:32.200 --> 00:08:34.010
How disgusting!

00:08:34.130 --> 00:08:36.080
Such fawning.

00:08:36.110 --> 00:08:37.120
Yeah!

00:08:37.280 --> 00:08:39.120
What's that supposed to mean?!

00:08:39.250 --> 00:08:41.230
I mean, come on.

00:08:42.060 --> 00:08:44.010
I can see why, though.

00:08:45.290 --> 00:08:49.120
If there's something you want to say, then say it!

00:08:49.240 --> 00:08:52.260
I'm saying Ms. Kugami may be "butch".

00:08:55.030 --> 00:08:55.270
Is that good?

00:08:57.030 --> 00:08:58.080
It is, right?

00:09:01.080 --> 00:09:03.210
Well, why didn't you say so?

00:09:04.260 --> 00:09:06.170
You wanted a strawberry, right?

00:09:06.290 --> 00:09:09.140
Come, there's plenty to go around!

00:09:14.100 --> 00:09:16.000
Th...thanks.

00:09:17.150 --> 00:09:18.070
You're welcome.

00:09:20.220 --> 00:09:22.290
These are really good!

00:09:23.020 --> 00:09:25.030
You said it.

00:09:26.030 --> 00:09:27.070
Yui?

00:09:28.030 --> 00:09:29.050
Yui!

00:09:30.110 --> 00:09:31.290
Hey, what's wrong?

00:09:32.100 --> 00:09:36.130
Nothing, forget it.  Sorry for being such a nuisance.

00:09:37.280 --> 00:09:39.070
A "nuisance"?

00:09:39.180 --> 00:09:41.010
For starting a fight.

00:09:43.260 --> 00:09:46.140
You want to get along with everyone, right?

00:09:47.260 --> 00:09:50.160
No, just be myself.

00:09:53.200 --> 00:09:55.220
Watch where you're going!

00:09:56.050 --> 00:09:58.240
I'm sorry.

00:09:59.080 --> 00:10:00.280
Don't apologize.

00:10:02.020 --> 00:10:04.000
She bumped into you.

00:10:04.230 --> 00:10:05.290
Kajika...

00:10:07.190 --> 00:10:10.070
I don't like your attitude toward seniors.

00:10:11.190 --> 00:10:12.280
Apologize to Yui.

00:10:13.180 --> 00:10:14.180
Excuse me?

00:10:15.080 --> 00:10:16.270
Kajika, don't.

00:10:18.110 --> 00:10:19.270
I said, "apologize".

00:10:29.040 --> 00:10:30.150
You'll regret this.

00:10:35.290 --> 00:10:38.080
Kajika, are you nuts?!

00:10:38.110 --> 00:10:41.230
I heard she's got a real dangerous boyfriend!

00:10:42.060 --> 00:10:43.120
Dangerous?

00:10:44.260 --> 00:10:49.070
So what?  Everyone needs to apologize when they're wrong.

00:10:53.040 --> 00:10:57.110
I suppose so.  You're exactly right.

00:10:58.210 --> 00:11:00.210
I'm sorry for the way I acted.

00:11:03.280 --> 00:11:06.260
I grew up surrounded by adults.

00:11:07.040 --> 00:11:11.130
You're the first friend I've had who's my age.

00:11:11.290 --> 00:11:13.030
No way!

00:11:13.190 --> 00:11:16.150
Will you be my friend always?

00:11:17.170 --> 00:11:19.060
Of course I will!

00:11:19.260 --> 00:11:21.230
Good.  It's a promise then.

00:11:26.180 --> 00:11:29.290
I...I need to go to the bathroom!

00:11:30.020 --> 00:11:30.290
Yui.

00:11:35.040 --> 00:11:37.140
Lady Kajika, get serious!

00:11:38.020 --> 00:11:39.050
What?

00:11:39.230 --> 00:11:42.170
I'm always serious, Toranosuke.

00:11:44.200 --> 00:11:47.060
I'm trying hard to protect her.

00:11:47.210 --> 00:11:49.290
But she won't listen to me.

00:11:50.150 --> 00:11:56.050
My apologies.  But she insists on walking home with her friend.

00:11:57.010 --> 00:11:58.160
It's not your fault.

00:11:59.010 --> 00:12:01.230
Once Kajika makes up her mind, no one can stop her.

00:12:02.100 --> 00:12:04.000
Except for "him".

00:12:05.120 --> 00:12:10.110
I never thought there were girls who get driven to school by limousine.

00:12:10.250 --> 00:12:12.160
Is that rare?

00:12:13.270 --> 00:12:17.010
But walking seems a lot better.

00:12:18.000 --> 00:12:19.230
There's lots to discover.

00:12:20.260 --> 00:12:22.010
You think so?

00:12:23.040 --> 00:12:27.160
It's always the same old, boring thing for me.

00:12:29.230 --> 00:12:32.120
Whassup?  Got a sec?

00:12:33.280 --> 00:12:39.070
Oh no, they're friends of that senior that we met!

00:12:39.210 --> 00:12:42.030
Somebody wants to see you.

00:12:42.030 --> 00:12:44.110
Kajika!

00:12:45.080 --> 00:12:46.120
Let Yui go!

00:12:47.010 --> 00:12:47.280
I'll go with you.

00:12:48.130 --> 00:12:50.070
You learn fast.

00:12:50.190 --> 00:12:55.000
Run Kajika!  They're not interested in what you have to say!

00:12:55.150 --> 00:12:56.210
Why you...

00:12:57.050 --> 00:12:58.140
Lady Kajika!

00:12:58.290 --> 00:13:00.140
Toranosuke!  Help Yui!

00:13:06.060 --> 00:13:07.110
Wow!

00:13:08.250 --> 00:13:09.260
Get in!

00:13:14.270 --> 00:13:15.270
Lady Kajika!

00:13:16.000 --> 00:13:17.050
Kajika!

00:13:33.130 --> 00:13:35.150
So you're the one who wants to see me?

00:13:35.280 --> 00:13:37.250
I like your nerve.

00:13:38.010 --> 00:13:41.230
Don't worry.  We'll treat you real nice...

00:13:48.580 --> 00:13:50.190
She's...

00:13:51.120 --> 00:13:52.270
Stop dawdling!

00:13:53.000 --> 00:13:55.220
Move it!  I'll handle this.

00:13:57.060 --> 00:13:58.010
Back off!

00:13:58.160 --> 00:14:00.200
This girl's mine!

00:14:00.230 --> 00:14:02.100
What?!

00:14:03.260 --> 00:14:04.250
Pathetic.

00:14:06.220 --> 00:14:09.230
How can you possibly make me yours?

00:14:10.280 --> 00:14:13.250
When my heart isn't even in here?

00:14:15.010 --> 00:14:18.250
As long as you seek to manipulate people through coercion...

00:14:19.150 --> 00:14:21.250
...you'll never escape your tiny prison.

00:14:23.040 --> 00:14:25.140
Why you conceited wench!

00:14:28.230 --> 00:14:31.170
We're gonna shut that big mouth of yours right now!

00:14:32.250 --> 00:14:33.210
Get her!

00:14:43.260 --> 00:14:47.150
Those children have no chance.

00:14:49.010 --> 00:14:51.080
You came!  Lee-Leng!

00:14:51.080 --> 00:14:54.080
Anytime you call.

00:15:00.040 --> 00:15:00.500
I'm sure I saw...

00:15:01.200 --> 00:15:06.130
Something outside the realm of ordinary.

00:15:14.190 --> 00:15:16.130
Why are you pouting?

00:15:17.150 --> 00:15:18.200
This wasn't the deal.

00:15:19.060 --> 00:15:22.080
Dad said I could stay in Japan.

00:15:22.220 --> 00:15:24.200
It's only been a month.

00:15:25.120 --> 00:15:28.130
Nobody defies Harry's orders, Kajika.

00:15:30.120 --> 00:15:32.130
You understand too much.

00:15:34.200 --> 00:15:36.280
Someone else looks dissatisfied.

00:15:37.060 --> 00:15:39.200
No, I'm not.

00:15:40.040 --> 00:15:44.150
We'll be in New York in 30 minutes.  Speak your mind now.

00:15:46.100 --> 00:15:50.230
I thought I was entrusted to be Lady Kajika's bodyguard.

00:15:51.070 --> 00:15:54.250
I didn't think that someone else would have the job too.

00:15:55.070 --> 00:15:57.210
I just happened to be free.

00:15:58.060 --> 00:16:03.070
I secretly came to Japan to surprise Kajika.

00:16:04.010 --> 00:16:09.010
But if I injured your pride... I'm sorry.

00:16:09.260 --> 00:16:11.250
No, that's ok.

00:16:17.210 --> 00:16:19.080
Excuse me, Chairman.

00:16:20.030 --> 00:16:23.220
Lady Kajika is due to arrive on schedule at 6 p.m.

00:16:25.110 --> 00:16:27.220
Understood.  Bring the car around.

00:16:28.060 --> 00:16:29.170
I'll wait at the manor.

00:16:35.250 --> 00:16:38.000
It's been six months.

00:16:41.290 --> 00:16:44.130
How beautiful she must've grown.

00:16:46.020 --> 00:16:50.060
How fragrantly brilliant she must've blossomed.

00:16:51.010 --> 00:16:55.010
That will only make the game that is about to begin more interesting.

00:16:56.050 --> 00:17:01.180
Until she eventually takes her place atop the Burnsworth empire.

00:17:03.070 --> 00:17:08.170
For you, my dear, are the only scion of Harry Burnsworth.

00:17:11.010 --> 00:17:12.260
You're still angry?

00:17:14.270 --> 00:17:16.090
It's not fair.

00:17:17.170 --> 00:17:21.210
I can't compete with the mature-beyond-his-years Lee-Leng.

00:17:22.120 --> 00:17:26.070
A ha, so it's your boyish looks that bother you.

00:17:26.100 --> 00:17:28.020
So what if it is?!

00:17:28.160 --> 00:17:30.040
Don't worry about it.

00:17:32.130 --> 00:17:34.150
Lee-Leng's overly mature.

00:17:38.070 --> 00:17:42.020
I guess he has to be to become the leader...

00:17:42.100 --> 00:17:45.040
...of a Chinese conglomerate like the Huang Group.

00:17:46.070 --> 00:17:50.110
I could never compare to a man like that.

00:17:51.030 --> 00:17:54.190
Lee-Leng's been that way since we met.

00:17:55.270 --> 00:18:00.270
At nine, he seemed more mature than the maids on the island.

00:18:02.120 --> 00:18:06.170
Dad had given him Mustafa, still a cub, as a present.

00:18:08.110 --> 00:18:11.160
Pleased to meet you.  Let's be friends.

00:18:13.190 --> 00:18:17.120
His eyes seemed vacant... devoid of emotion.

00:18:18.200 --> 00:18:21.020
They filled me with sadness.

00:18:23.220 --> 00:18:25.140
Look at me!

00:18:26.240 --> 00:18:28.280
You have to look at me!

00:18:30.270 --> 00:18:32.200
For a brief moment...

00:18:37.120 --> 00:18:42.040
I saw him look flustered.  And I was relieved.

00:18:47.060 --> 00:18:47.260
Dad!

00:18:48.110 --> 00:18:49.040
My dearest!

00:18:50.200 --> 00:18:51.280
I missed you!

00:18:52.060 --> 00:18:54.270
So did I.  Did you like Japan?

00:18:58.090 --> 00:18:59.210
Don't remind me!

00:19:00.080 --> 00:19:02.050
You broke your promise!

00:19:02.170 --> 00:19:04.210
What kind of greeting is that, Kajika?

00:19:06.040 --> 00:19:11.130
First, explain to me why you had to call me back.

00:19:12.010 --> 00:19:16.010
Events started moving faster than I had expected.

00:19:16.090 --> 00:19:18.290
So we needed to talk.

00:19:19.210 --> 00:19:20.260
"Events"?

00:19:22.240 --> 00:19:25.260
Lee-Leng!  Stay here.

00:19:28.270 --> 00:19:29.280
12 years ago...

00:19:30.190 --> 00:19:36.130
I sent 2-year-old Kajika to my island in the Caribbean...

00:19:37.090 --> 00:19:40.160
...isolating her from the rest of the world.

00:19:41.110 --> 00:19:44.000
Because mom was murdered, right?

00:19:44.130 --> 00:19:48.240
I was about to be kidnapped, but mom stopped them.

00:19:49.120 --> 00:19:51.020
That's not all.

00:19:51.110 --> 00:19:51.550
What?

00:19:52.180 --> 00:19:57.130
You're burdened with an even greater destiny you must fulfill.

00:19:59.120 --> 00:20:00.120
What destiny?

00:20:00.260 --> 00:20:07.020
That I'll tell you when the man who is to be your husband sits there.

00:20:07.070 --> 00:20:08.060
"Husband"?

00:20:08.280 --> 00:20:12.190
Who knows when that'll be?  Tell me now.

00:20:13.060 --> 00:20:16.270
In that case, how about playing a game, Kajika?

00:20:17.130 --> 00:20:18.120
Huh?

00:20:18.190 --> 00:20:24.130
You will meet three men, each of whom I've chosen.

00:20:25.040 --> 00:20:29.060
Of those three, you are to choose your life partner.

00:20:30.240 --> 00:20:32.050
This is a joke, right?

00:20:32.230 --> 00:20:34.150
No, it's not.

00:20:34.250 --> 00:20:39.250
You will choose one of them, and make him choose you.

00:20:40.290 --> 00:20:42.090
"Make him"?

00:20:42.120 --> 00:20:47.260
Yes.  They are unaware that I have chosen them.

00:20:48.260 --> 00:20:53.110
They don't know who you are, and I won't tell you their names.

00:20:53.270 --> 00:20:58.020
I'm simply ensuring that your paths will cross.

00:20:58.110 --> 00:21:00.000
Sound fair?

00:21:01.240 --> 00:21:06.090
How can you be so sure I'll pick someone you've chosen?

00:21:06.290 --> 00:21:07.250
You will.

00:21:09.070 --> 00:21:13.180
I've spent 12 years searching for these men.

00:21:14.060 --> 00:21:18.210
They each bear a radiance that makes them irresistible.

00:21:18.240 --> 00:21:21.030
Their presence will be felt.

00:21:21.290 --> 00:21:26.180
What if I don't find "your choice" the least bit to my liking?

00:21:28.120 --> 00:21:31.080
Then they and I will admit defeat.

00:21:31.280 --> 00:21:34.290
Let me repeat: this is a game.

00:21:35.080 --> 00:21:38.170
You're free to play or not.

00:21:40.080 --> 00:21:43.150
Of course, you're already counting on my acceptance.

00:21:50.040 --> 00:21:51.120
Fine.

00:21:54.170 --> 00:21:57.280
Lee-Leng...you're like a brother to Kajika.

00:21:58.110 --> 00:22:01.050
See who she chooses, and who chooses her.

00:22:01.170 --> 00:22:05.110
I need you to determine if that man is right for her.

00:22:06.000 --> 00:22:09.110
So I want you to stay by her and watch.

00:22:10.000 --> 00:22:13.120
Of course, you'll be amply rewarded for it.

00:22:13.260 --> 00:22:19.150
If it will strengthen relations between the Huang and Burnsworth Groups...

00:22:20.150 --> 00:22:21.110
Yes.

00:22:22.160 --> 00:22:25.080
Then I have no choice but to agree.

00:22:26.280 --> 00:22:28.110
You have my gratitude, Lee-Leng.

00:22:33.230 --> 00:22:36.280
Such self-control, Lee-Leng.

00:22:37.060 --> 00:22:41.290
But your lack of a reaction does leave a little to be desired.

00:22:43.130 --> 00:22:45.260
The die is cast.
